# Minimal Corvus Tor SOCKS proxy configuration.
#
# This is a plain Tor client (no hidden service, no relay/exit function). It
# exists to give one specific, opt-in, higher-risk collector (the Instagram/
# Amazon phone-presence checks) an outbound path that is isolated from the
# deployment's own egress IP, so a platform detecting and blocking that
# traffic pattern cannot also degrade Corvus' other, legitimate collectors
# that share the deployment's real network egress.
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
RunAsDaemon 0
Log notice stdout
AvoidDiskWrites 1
